Package: infiltrator-software
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gpgv, pkexec
Recommends: flatpak
Description: unified Infiltrator software manager and updater
 Infiltrator Software provides one graphical surface for software discovery,
 installed applications, updates, system components, repositories, history
 and repair. The native Debian compatibility engine is replacing APT command
 dependencies while retaining Debian repositories and .deb compatibility.
